You should be able to make schottky simply by typing:

make

then:

./schottky

to run. You need to have X11 installed.  On OSX, this means
installing XQuartz from http://xquartz.macosforge.org/

Only the interactive program needs X11.  The two headless tools need
neither the headers nor the library, so on a machine with no display
type instead:

make headless

which builds certify_arc and funddom only.  See "Building without X11"
in README.md.